name syzygy-wdl
match *.rtbw
# A WDL table, decoded: a line a legal position of its material, FEN \t verdict, the verdict for the side to move under
# the 50-move rule as Syzygy names it: win, cursed win (a win the 50-move rule draws), draw, blessed loss (a loss it
# saves), loss. Each line is [P, "win/draw/loss", verdict] of its position P, nothing else: no move, no game.
input decode syzygy
tier position by \n
names fen wdl
tier field by \t
part fen grammar fen
content fen wdl
thing position fen
relation "win/draw/loss" wdl
attest position wdl
